_refine_special_details          
;
Refinement on F^2^ for ALL reflections except for 0 with very negative
F^2^ or flagged by the user for potential systematic errors.  Weighted
R-factors wR and all goodnesses of fit S are based on F^2^, conventional
R-factors R are based on F, with F set to zero for negative F^2^. 
The observed criterion of F^2^ > 2sigma(F^2^) is used only for 
calculating _R_factor_obs etc. and is not relevant to the choice of 
reflections for refinement.  R-factors based on F^2^ are statistically 
about twice as large as those based on F, and R-factors based on ALL 
data will be even larger.
;

